Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Ninth Episode\NThe Melted Icicle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, blinded,\Nhas been taken away by Mephisto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She knows that the King and the Queen\Nare on the Island of Snakes..
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,..turned into stone statues.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.58,0:02:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Helped by Hecate, daughter of Mephisto,\Nshe tries to help them, but falls into the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.82,0:02:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She is saved by the pirate Blood
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.06,0:02:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,With him she goes to the magic spring..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...and thanks to the miraculous water\Nshe regains her sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.62,0:02:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then she returns to Coolland to\Nfight Queen Icicle,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,who has built a new\Npowerful weapon: the iron lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire confronts him\Nand manages to destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.74,0:02:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the battle, her\Nfriend Tink is hit...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,..and Sapphire\Nbelieves him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate arrives to warn Sapphire\Nthat her father and mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...are in danger, because Mephisto\Nwants to smash their statues to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.34,0:02:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire sets off immediately\Nfor the Island of Serpents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for? Make\Na second iron lion immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.02,0:03:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a mission to\Nthe Crystal Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's horrible! The Queen\Nis a terrible woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...for having asked to\Nmake such a weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrest that young man!\NHe spoke ill of the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saved! Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.34,0:03:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that Sapphire\Nis worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sapphire, where\Nare you? Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.50,0:03:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I will ask the birds,\Nthey will know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me where Sapphire is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.50,0:04:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Mephisto, I have come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.62,0:04:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...because I want you to\Nhelp my father and my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! I will do it if you promise\Nme that you won't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't run away! I\Nswear on my sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.34,0:04:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...that I won't run away!\N- All right, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Alé Satàn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, my dear!\N- Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- How do you feel?\N- Fine, I think!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- I think I heard Sapphire's voice.\N- Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Alé Satàn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing! Can't you send\NSapphire's parents to the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.82,0:04:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about them! I can't\Nalways take care of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.34,0:04:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How mean you are!\NThey will starve to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:04:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.90,0:05:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There are people on\Nthe Island of Serpents!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- People?\N- Yes, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And the people on the island are\Nthe King and Queen of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me! Go there\Nimmediately, we must catch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop! You are under arrest!\N- What are you doing? We are not criminals!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.34,0:05:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...tonight you will be born\Na second time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't wait\Nfor this moment to arrive
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be a witch\Nwith a heart of stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.86,0:06:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,In celebration of the birth\Nof my witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunder, lightning, toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you tired? Now I'll have someone\Ntake over for you, we're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands are paralyzed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.98,0:06:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cursed Mephisto, go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.22,0:07:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink! So you're alive!\N- Of course I'm alive! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.62,0:07:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the Island of Snakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But... there is no one there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,As I predicted, Mephisto has sent\Nmy father and my mother away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's incredible,\Nsuch a kind devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm going back to Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's just a passing bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.78,0:08:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- We'll wait for you next year!\N- Thank you, birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.22,0:08:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is this the entrance to the secret passage?\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to enter\Nthrough the secret passage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Because, as I told you, there\Nis a fake Sapphire in the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go this way because\Notherwise they might.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...send us back\Nlike last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.94,0:08:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If we go left\Nwe'll reach the crypt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, this is moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.62,0:08:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.58,0:08:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful not to fall\Ninto that old well!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:08:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrible place\Nthis is! My goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.18,0:09:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move,\Nsomeone is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you! How did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.90,0:09:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This damn fake Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- But this is my room!\N- Now we are safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.\NIt's an eagle, don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,An eagle?! How beautiful and big it is!\NWho knows where it comes from? Hello! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:10:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- What does it say?\N- My father and my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...have been taken\Nby Queen Icicle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily we managed\Nto take prisoner...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- the King and Queen of Silverland!\N- Then it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All this thanks\Nto the great power of the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow the Queen herself\Nwill send a letter to Silverland..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...asking them to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You will pretend to be Sapphire until\Nthe very end, you will come to Coolland...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...and you will affix\Nthe seal of surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.62,0:10:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.42,0:10:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can't!\N- But if you don't surrender
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father and your mother will face\Nreal danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I help\Nmy father and my mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...and at the same time\Nprotect Silverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.94,0:10:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know either.\NAnyway, what is certain,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...is that we must destroy\NQueen Icicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Queen Icicle?!\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if you are strong,\Nyou cannot do such a thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...because there are many soldiers\Nfollowing the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Yes, I can do it!\NIt's easy for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I will pretend to be the fake Sapphire\Nand I will go visit the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If Sapphire were to die\Nit would be truly terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I must help her at all costs
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The eagle is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.70,0:11:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it!\NI'll ask Peter of the woods!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Peter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.50,0:11:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Peter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Peter! Hi!\NI have to ask you a favor, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.62,0:11:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me to the Crystal Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Crystal Valley...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.90,0:12:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many people there\Nwho love Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.58,0:12:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was there too,\Nthey all treated me lovingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.34,0:12:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They were only brought there\Nbecause they opposed the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.34,0:12:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to free them somehow,\Nso they will help Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, use your instinct to find\Nthe hole the mice know, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.90,0:13:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Peter!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.74,0:13:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.90,0:13:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I have to ask you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, call the largest\Nnumber of your friends possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.62,0:13:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Go down, now! From today\Non, you will work in this valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How wicked he is!\NYou will pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder\Nwhat Sapphire is doing now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.58,0:13:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire,\Ndo your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:13:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn Nylon, he thinks\NI'm the fake Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, now you can take off\Nyour mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your performance\Nwas admirable!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.42,0:14:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can speak freely\Nbecause it's just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know his\Nname How can I deceive him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.22,0:14:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please, shut up!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.46,0:14:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If I speak to you in a different\Nway than usual, Gelo will scold me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.58,0:14:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's better if I don't\Nspeak to you at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.02,0:14:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know! Gelo is\Nvery strict, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.18,0:15:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.42,0:15:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I will arrive\Nat Coolland Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.42,0:15:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I might die...\NOh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to help my father and\Nmy mother, if I let myself be overcome...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...by weakness.\NI must be stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.82,0:16:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?\NSoon we will reach the tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.14,0:16:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In the tunnel there is no\Nsnow all the way to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be lazy!\NHurry up! And work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.54,0:16:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But those are mice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousands of mice!\NHelp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.42,0:16:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mice! Come on, little mice, fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.90,0:17:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bite those arrogant soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray! Hooray! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We are free! We are free!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.50,0:17:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends, please, help Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.90,0:17:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's defeat\NQueen Icicle together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.46,0:17:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She thinks I am the fake Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.30,0:17:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking on\Nthese troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a real pleasure, Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can relax!\NThere is no one here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.98,0:17:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,except those who know\Nthat you are the fake Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.74,0:18:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes...\N- Now, if you affix the seal here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Silverland will become mine!\N- But before that, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.94,0:18:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is it? - Have you really\Ncaptured the King and the Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.74,0:18:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Duke Duralumin\Nis truly worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...and ordered me\Nto make sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How cowardly!\NAll right, I'll show them to you! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- You are Sapphire, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.02,0:18:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid they are!\NThis is not your daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- No?!\N- I'm sure it's Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Mother!\NPlease, be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.70,0:19:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Take off your mask!\N- Of course, I'll take it off right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.58,0:19:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the cell if you don't\Nwant me to kill the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.62,0:19:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought!\NYou are...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's true, I am the real Sapphire!\N- What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.66,0:19:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you my other face!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the Phantom Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We will take Ghiacciolo\Nas a hostage...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.02,0:19:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...and no one will hurt us!\N- Thank you, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.42,0:19:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Gelo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill the Phantom Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.34,0:20:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, mother..!\N- Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.74,0:20:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.70,0:20:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an earthquake!\NBut it's lasting too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.02,0:20:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The water in the moat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The water level is dropping!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cursed prisoners!\NFire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's time to defeat the\NQueen - Come on, take up arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's help our comrades!\N- Come on, here! Take them! Take them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.26,0:21:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,\Nthe castle is burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.30,0:21:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!\NKill Queen Icicle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.90,0:21:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The people managed to get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's kill her!\N- Let's catch her and kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.42,0:21:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What are\Nall my soldiers doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My Queen,\Nthe soldiers have betrayed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.62,0:21:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They have joined the people\Nand are about to attack you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.86,0:21:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away or you will die like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.62,0:21:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, Gelo, let's escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.82,0:21:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!\NThe Queen has escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The fountain is a secret passage!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.66,0:22:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, this must be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.10,0:22:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, please be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.78,0:22:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Gelo!\NQueen Icicle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.10,0:22:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! Gelo!\NHelp! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.74,0:22:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.10,0:22:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- The Queen has disappeared!\N- Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.82,0:23:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, people of Coolland!\NIt was you who helped me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.06,0:23:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And so: long live Coolland!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.74,0:23:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Long live!\N- Hooray! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.94,0:23:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is she saying?\N- Nothing. She's just spoiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.18,0:23:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Grand Duke, the King is coming!\N- What?!
